00:24:52.220 --> 00:25:11.210
<v Kevin>It was kind of interesting, though. After this was all over, after he had testified and Allan was put away, of course, Allan's daughters, I believe, then owned the buildings. So of course, Bob lost his free apartment and his super's position. And it was almost like he kind of deflated.
<v Kevin>不过，这倒是挺有趣的。这一切结束之后，在他作证并把艾伦送进去之后，当然，我相信艾伦的女儿们接手了这栋楼。所以，鲍勃当然失去了免费的公寓和管理员职位。他几乎就像瘪了气一样。

00:25:11.210 --> 00:25:33.440
<v Kevin>Nobody had to talk to him anymore, so he would walk around-- it was almost pathetic. He'd walk up and down the block and say hi. And people would just kind of go by-- nod to him and go by. And then after a short time after this, he just wasn't around anymore. He was gone. And I have no idea where he went to. Where is he anyway? Did you find out anyway?
<v Kevin>没人再需要跟他说话了，所以他就在街上走来走去——这几乎令人同情。他会在街区里走来走去打招呼。而人们只会匆匆走过——向他点个头就走掉。在这之后不久，他就不见了。他走了。我不知道他去了哪儿。无论如何他到底在哪儿？你查到了吗？

