00:39:23.220 --> 00:39:44.130
<v Josh Bearman>Well, also bench pressing in particular is like, you require a bench. So I still don't understand. Let's say they found the snowman in the woods, then did he have his own bench? Was it made out of snow? He wasn't doing squats.
