<v Dennis>Yeah.
<v Dennis>是的。

00:43:57.170 --> 00:43:59.120
<v Ira Glass>Wow.
<v Ira Glass>哇。

00:43:59.120 --> 00:44:10.300
<v Dennis>I was like, Dad, we got to kick these people out. We got to get rid of them. And my dad was very reluctant to do that. And he was like, work with them. Work it out. Work with them.
<v Dennis>我对父亲说，我们必须把这些人赶走。我们必须摆脱他们。我父亲很不情愿那样做。他说，和他们合作。解决它。和他们合作。

00:44:10.300 --> 00:44:11.230
<v Ira Glass>Now why? Like, why?
<v Ira Glass>为什么要这么做？为什么要？

00:44:11.230 --> 00:44:19.690
<v Dennis>Well, he knew that her husband had a good job. And he knew that they had money coming in and that you could get money out of them, basically.
